-- KETABET ELSE IF --------------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0903

`elif` w `else if (…) {` men loghat tanya. F Kalam el far3 elly ba3do yetketeb `walla law shart:`.

4│     elif n == 0:
       ^^^^

Garrab: `walla law`

Mosa3da: Ekteb `walla law` w ba3daha el shart w `:`, men gher aqwas. `kalam fix` bey3mel keda lak.

